      ":question/id": "b6c1d13e-58bd-57d8-918b-0a1bebf09fb1",
      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-49173",
      ":question/problem": "$\\int {(1+5{x}^{2})}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x=$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {(1+5{x}^{2})}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1+10{x}^{2}+25{x}^{4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =25\\int {x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x+10\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =25\\left(\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5}\\right)+10\\left(\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}\\right)+(x)+C \\\\  & =5{x}^{5}+\\frac{10{x}^{3}}{3}+x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
    "key_origin": "missing fields; unsupported"
  },
